Z||000000||Oreif||03-15-2001||08:38 PM||||If you know of any that are not on the list please add them here so everyone can see them.<P><BR><B>MARCH 2001</B><P>Florida Fiero Weekend 2001<P>Daytona Beach, Fl.<P>March 23-25 (Show day, March 24th)<P>Contact: Mitchell Bell    proud88gt@aol.com  or<P>Frank Martin dragon@yourlink.net  or<BR> <A HREF="http://www.floridafieros.org" TARGET=_blank>www.floridafieros.org</A> <P>*************************** <P><B>APRIL 2001</B><P> <P><BR>*************************************** <P><BR> 3rd Annual  Fiero Swap Meet - Fiero Factory<P>Toney, Al.<P>April 27-29<P>Contact: Ed Parks<P>Fierofactory@juno.com<P>**************************** <P>Gateway Fiero Show 2001<P>St Louis Mo , Museum Of Transportation<P>April 28th<P>Contact: Mike & Karen Thorn<P>stlfieros@yahoo.com<P> <BR>**************************<BR> <P><B>MAY 2001</B><P>Twin Lakes Fiero Fest<P>Paxton, Il.<P>May 5th<P>Bob Steiger 217-379-9140<P>fierobob@localline2.com<P>************************************* <P>Fieros at Carlisle 2001<P>Carlisle, Pa.<P>May 19<P>Contact Bob Schlag<P>bobschlag@cyberia.com<BR> <A HREF="http://users.desupernet.com/pages/mafoa/carlisle2000.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://users.desupernet.com/pages/mafoa/carlisle2000.htm</A> <P>****************************************** <P>9th Annual SW Regional Fiero Fest 2001<P>Norman, Oklahoma<P>May 19th<P>Contact Gary Mann<P>877-857-1521 or<P>9thAnnual@glmann.com<P>********************************** <P>Spring Car Show/Northern Regional<P>Medina, MN.<P>May 19th<P>Contact  Pete Grosz<P>651-773-4135<P>pggroz@yahoo.com<P>********************************** <P><B>JUNE 2001</B><P>Midwest Regionals Dells 2001 A Fiero Odyssey<P>Wisconsin Dells, Wi<P>May 31st June 3rd (Show Day June 2nd)<P>Contact: Tom Podziemski    theprezzz@worldnet.att.net<P>414-282-3577<P>*************************************** <P>FOCONE Summer Show Weekend<P>Old Orchard Beach, ME<P>June 15-16 (Show day June 16th)<P>Tim Perrigo tim@fieroparts.com or Chris Schaefer cj_schaefer@snet.net<P>********************************** <BR>Fiero Roundup V<P>San Antonio, TX<P>June 30 - July 1<P>Contact Robert White 210-622-9080 or email:<P>aafo@mail.evi.net<P><BR><B>JULY 2001</B><P> <P>Michigan Fiero Fest 2001<P>Frankenmuth, Mi<P>July 13-15 (Show day July 14)<P>Contact: Robert or Shelly Holtz 517-589-5128<P>email ivoryfiero@aol.com or<P>michfieroclub@yahoo.com<P> <BR>*********************************<BR>The 2001 San Francisco Bay Area Fiero Fest<BR>July 13-15<BR>San Leandro, CA<BR>Contact George Miller 510-233-4376 or view the information and register on the CFOG web site <A HREF="http://www.cfog.org" TARGET=_blank>www.cfog.org</A>  <P><BR>********************************** <P><B>AUGUST 2001</B><BR>NORTHWEST FIERO FEST<BR>AUGUST 10-12<BR>Richland Wa.<BR>ar Shilo In and McCurley Pontiac: public hours 11-2 Saturday (car show)<BR>Contact Ben Didlot 12530-182nd Ave SE,<BR>Snohomish Wa 98290<BR>BENJAMATIC@aol.com<BR>***********************************<P>FOCOA 17th Annual Fiero Festival<P>Williamsburg, Va.<P>August 2-5th (Show Day August 4th)<P>Contact: Fiero Phil Huff<P>Fierophillhuff@fieroowners.com<P>Local Contact:: Curry Obenshain<P>captfiero@aol.com<P>804-693-4650<P>********************************* <P>Central Illinois Fiero Show<P>El Paso, Illinois<P>August 11th  11AM  to 4PM<P>Contact: Michael Schaefer<P>sheilaridez@hotmail.com<P>Show Web Site:  <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/1930/elpasoshow.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/1930/elpasoshow.html</A> <P> <P>*********************************** <P> <P><B>SEPTEMBER 2001</B><P>Fierorama 2001<P>Oakbrook Il. (Chicago area)<P>September 9th<P>Contact: Jim Hallman or Paul Vargyas<P>jjh93@juno.com   or   paulv@xnet.com<P> <BR>**********************************<BR> <P>FOCONE Fall Show and Cruise<P>Rutland, MA<P>September 23rd<P>Contact Tim Perrigo  tim@fieroparts.com or<P>Chris Schafer  cj_schafer@snet.net<P>This list updated 01/17/01<P>(Sorry Tim, I corrected it. Thanks